==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''Maoism'''

# The [[philosophy]] espoused by [[w:Mao Zedong|Mao Zedong]] of the [[w:Communist Party of China|Communist Party of China]].
# The [[act]] or [[state]] of living in accord with the [[philosophy]] of Chairman Mao Zedong.

